# Local environment for this build.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) for local `vite` dev, and set the same vars in the
# hosting project's environment settings for a deployed site.
#
# PLACEHOLDERS ONLY in this file — it is committed. Never paste a real secret.
#
# Every variable is optional: the app runs without a .env at all.
# NOTE: a VITE_-prefixed var is inlined into the client bundle and is readable
# by anyone who loads the page.

# Overrides the `?access=…` URL token that skips the sign-in form.
# Defaults to `rdvr@9705` when unset — see src/config/access.ts.
# This is a demo gate, not a secret.
VITE_POC_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_token_here

# Point the conversation at a real API instead of the recorded scripts (both
# must be set; see docs/standard/api.md). `npm run mock-api` serves the
# recorded answers on http://localhost:5650 to try this locally.
# VITE_ULTRA_API_MODE=http
# VITE_ULTRA_API_BASE=http://localhost:5650
